<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Bagley Q3 net loss $5.16 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Bagley Q3 net loss $5.16 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended September 30.</p>
<p>Net loss $5.16 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>Net revenue $190.8 vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: The food company said it had an extraordinary loss in the period of $4.85 million.</p>
<p>Net assets were $178.5 million.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were given.</p>
<p>Full name is Bagley SA. The company is owned by France's Danone food group.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 3180668</p>
</text>
